- setlists/: exported or generated setlist text named from the normalized Show metadata. For replacement/cleanup, only the exact setlist filename for a Show and its canonical (altN) collision variants are treated as one family; a longer Show name that merely begins with the same text is not included. This prevents a shorter re-inventory from deleting a retained longer-named show setlist. TLOHome/logs/setlists directories are enumerated literally rather than embedded in glob patterns, so legal path characters such as [ and ] do not cause silent misses.}
